## Build products
.build/
DerivedData/
*.xcresult
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Agent/script artifacts (screenshots, videos, result summaries)
artifacts/

## Per-worktree liveness marker. This must remain ignored so a heartbeat does
## not make an otherwise clean task worktree appear dirty.
.worktree-session
# Legacy Apple-platform task-resource files remain ignored so adopted projects
# can be cleaned safely without making every imported worktree appear dirty.
.worktree-env
.worktree-sim-owner

## Transient record-mode authorization (created/removed by record-snapshots.sh)
.snapshot-record-token
.snapshot-operation-lock

## User state
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
.DS_Store

## Agent local state — the shared skills (.claude/skills symlink) ARE committed
## so clones keep Claude Code parity; per-machine settings are not
.claude/settings.local.json

## SPM
Packages/*/.build/
Packages/*/.swiftpm/
.swiftpm/
Tools/XcodeBuildMCP/node_modules/

## mise local overrides
.mise.local.toml

## Python bytecode from script helpers
__pycache__/
